{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">在節目《在家宴客60道菜》中，李家鼎（鼎爺）親自示範了一道極具風味的「豬油渣芋頭臘味煲仔飯」。這道菜式巧妙地運用五花腩炸出香脆的豬油渣與清澈豬油，再搭配油脂豐富的臘鴨腿、臘腸及膶腸，讓甘香的鴨油與豬油層層滲透進芋頭與米飯之中，香氣極其濃郁！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"d2094a6e-73f9-4f01-99dc-d98b8c42224a.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026IWwDvSDGhJ1791365809.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"d2094a6e-73f9-4f01-99dc-d98b8c42224a.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"></h3><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>做法</strong></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第一部分：提煉香脆豬油渣</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ff2cd92c-0c49-469a-9356-510f5e154369.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/10/2026jNL95gQqKL1791365809.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ff2cd92c-0c49-469a-9356-510f5e154369.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>第二部分：炮製芋頭臘味煲仔飯</strong></p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>貼士</strong></p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ul></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-09T09:58:42.648192+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":154,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}